+The watchers read that marker to tell the reviewer's reply from the author's
+answer. `settle` posts the reply as the reviewer, then sets the thread by the
+result:
+
+| `--result` | The thread |
+| --- | --- |
+| `fixed`, `accepted`, `withdrawn` | Resolved |
+| `reopened` | Unresolved |
+| `kept` | Left as it is |
